description: Inline image `![alt](source)`. Emits `<$image source="source" alt="..." tooltip="...">` — TW's image widget renders BOTH internal image tiddlers AND external URLs through the same syntax. TW-markdown-plugin compat: `#`-prefix (`![alt](#Image.jpg)`) forces internal routing, `<...>` brackets wrap names with whitespace, trailing `"..."` becomes the tooltip. When `source` resolves to a tiddler with an `alt-text` field, that field still populates the rendered `alt` and `tooltip`; an explicit `"..."` tooltip overrides for tooltip while alt stays from the field.
